Audio
-----

3.5 mm Audio In/Out
*******************

The product features a 3.5mm audio connector as shown in the image below.

.. rst-class:: text-center

   |audio_img|

   *Audio Connector*

This connector supports both earphone output and microphone input. 

There is no on board microphone for this product.

After inserting a 3.5mm device, the on board speaker will be muted.

Internal Speaker
****************

The product also has an internal 2W speaker, meaning you can play music without an earphone, the sound can be played from the product directly.

Buzzer
******

The product has an internal buzzer, suitable for playing beep sounds for alarms.

